{"id": 535, "speaker": 2, "form": "dlg", "jp": "（‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥‥）"},
{"id": 536, "speaker": 2, "form": "dlg", "jp": "「そうだね‥‥」"},
